title: "freq-lab: a GPS-disciplined space-weather station on an FPGA"
abstract: "VLF solar-flare receivers, lightning time-of-arrival location, a 30 MHz riometer and a live dashboard on an FPGA. Verified in simulation and on the PC; not yet run on hardware."
